        "title": "Passive Sensors: Multispectral, Hyperspectral, Thermal",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Passive optical sensors record reflected solar energy (shortwave: 0.4-2.5 um) and/or thermally emitted energy (longwave TIR: 8-14 um). The fundamental question is spectral design: how many bands, where, and how wide? The answer determines what science is possible."
    },
